            "detailed_description": "<h1>Awesome Reviews</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/8a1a4c30ad4d39063f1e78282291f519.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/325701aaf3963a6985415cf55751fd77.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=181 /></span><br><br><strong>Super Mega Space Blaster Special Turbo</strong> é um viciante e frenético space shooter com elementos de bullet hell, repleto de bônus desbloqueáveis e tabelas de classificação para subir. A edição 'Turbo' é a edição definitiva entregando mais naves, mais modos de jogo, mais desbloqueáveis, mais desafios e mais diversão explosiva espacial do que nunca. Abra seu caminho através de 5 modos de jogo únicos neste blaster espacial fácil de se jogar mas dificil de se dominar.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/02bc3f4944f6b5499aa9253caf863f9e.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gameplay sh'mup frenético e viciante<br></li><li>5 modos de jogo que entregam mecânicas e rejogabilidade variadas<br></li><li>Jogue com um amigo em modos multijogador local ou competitivo<br></li><li>Colete moedas para desbloquear todos os 15 space blasters<br></li><li>Space blaster exclusivo para Steam<br></li><li>Alguns space blasters tem torres, tornando o jogo em um shooter twin-stick<br></li><li>Muitas melhorias de armas incríveis <br></li><li>Use suas moedas na loja para aprimorar armas e desbloquear mais benefícios<br></li><li>Mais de 40 desafios in-game para ajudar você a aprimorar suas habilidades de piloto<br></li><li>Tabelas de classificação<br></li><li>Trilha sonora original em estilo anos 80 por Electric Fan Death</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/ddcbc9c3102dac0d28e3f348b97d2f6a.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=217 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the massively expanded 'Turbo Edition'. Jam-packed with new content and extra features giving you hours of punishingly difficult retro space blasting action.</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/37217a7cb07cb9fdae7639b6c1a54b73.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br>The year is 2051, the Earth is in ruin; a barely inhabitable polluted mess of smog and tar. A huge unmanned spaceship, launched by mankind years earlier as a last ditch attempt to survive, has found a possible inhabitable planet and is under attack from its residents.<br><br>That's where you come in pilot!<br><br>From earth you must remotely control one of the giant ship's space blasters and annihilate the alien threat so that humanity can continue. The survival of human kind is in your hands pilot. Don't let us down!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/ce8f19fe6fe3a9088f04ee7d99d067af.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br>We are a small video game development studio based in Greater Manchester, United Kingdom. After the success of Super Mega Space Blaster Special we decided to make a massively expanded 'Turbo Edition' whilst still continuing the development of our much bigger metroidvania action-RPG The Flawless: Art's Tale. Super Mega Space Blaster Special Turbo expands on the original in every area with more game modes, more space blasters, more challenges, more music, a huge shop, and loads more.<br><br>We wanted to make a shoot 'em up (shmup) that blended modern and retro mechanics to create a nostalgic yet up-to-date shooter that gives you the 'just one more go' feeling. Now you can be the judge of this, leave a Steam review and let us know what you think. We are open to feedback and want to improve the game in any way we can. If you have any issues with the game please feel free to let us know and we'll do our best to solve the problem. We hope you enjoy the game, Happy blasting!",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/325701aaf3963a6985415cf55751fd77.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=181 /></span><br><br><strong>Super Mega Space Blaster Special Turbo</strong> é um viciante e frenético space shooter com elementos de bullet hell, repleto de bônus desbloqueáveis e tabelas de classificação para subir. A edição 'Turbo' é a edição definitiva entregando mais naves, mais modos de jogo, mais desbloqueáveis, mais desafios e mais diversão explosiva espacial do que nunca. Abra seu caminho através de 5 modos de jogo únicos neste blaster espacial fácil de se jogar mas dificil de se dominar.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/02bc3f4944f6b5499aa9253caf863f9e.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gameplay sh'mup frenético e viciante<br></li><li>5 modos de jogo que entregam mecânicas e rejogabilidade variadas<br></li><li>Jogue com um amigo em modos multijogador local ou competitivo<br></li><li>Colete moedas para desbloquear todos os 15 space blasters<br></li><li>Space blaster exclusivo para Steam<br></li><li>Alguns space blasters tem torres, tornando o jogo em um shooter twin-stick<br></li><li>Muitas melhorias de armas incríveis <br></li><li>Use suas moedas na loja para aprimorar armas e desbloquear mais benefícios<br></li><li>Mais de 40 desafios in-game para ajudar você a aprimorar suas habilidades de piloto<br></li><li>Tabelas de classificação<br></li><li>Trilha sonora original em estilo anos 80 por Electric Fan Death</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/ddcbc9c3102dac0d28e3f348b97d2f6a.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=217 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the massively expanded 'Turbo Edition'. Jam-packed with new content and extra features giving you hours of punishingly difficult retro space blasting action.</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/37217a7cb07cb9fdae7639b6c1a54b73.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br>The year is 2051, the Earth is in ruin; a barely inhabitable polluted mess of smog and tar. A huge unmanned spaceship, launched by mankind years earlier as a last ditch attempt to survive, has found a possible inhabitable planet and is under attack from its residents.<br><br>That's where you come in pilot!<br><br>From earth you must remotely control one of the giant ship's space blasters and annihilate the alien threat so that humanity can continue. The survival of human kind is in your hands pilot. Don't let us down!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748330/extras/ce8f19fe6fe3a9088f04ee7d99d067af.avif?t=1794227982\" width=616 height=67 /></span><br>We are a small video game development studio based in Greater Manchester, United Kingdom. After the success of Super Mega Space Blaster Special we decided to make a massively expanded 'Turbo Edition' whilst still continuing the development of our much bigger metroidvania action-RPG The Flawless: Art's Tale. Super Mega Space Blaster Special Turbo expands on the original in every area with more game modes, more space blasters, more challenges, more music, a huge shop, and loads more.<br><br>We wanted to make a shoot 'em up (shmup) that blended modern and retro mechanics to create a nostalgic yet up-to-date shooter that gives you the 'just one more go' feeling. Now you can be the judge of this, leave a Steam review and let us know what you think. We are open to feedback and want to improve the game in any way we can. If you have any issues with the game please feel free to let us know and we'll do our best to solve the problem. We hope you enjoy the game, Happy blasting!",
